014it\u2019s a system.\n\nEvery piece of mail gets one decision:\u2028\ud83d\udcec Recycle\u2028\ud83d\udcc2 Action\u2028\ud83d\uddc3\ufe0f File\n\nOnce those decisions are made, the clutter never has a chance to build.\n\nSmall systems like this are what make a home feel calmer. They don\u2019t eliminate tasks\u2014they eliminate the constant mental load of wondering what to do next.\n\nWhat\u2019s one area of your home that needs a better system instead of more organizing?\n\n\u2714\ufe0fComment HOURS and I\u2019ll send you 10\nsystems that Save Me Hours Every Week and a couple other resources to help you get started!", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T00:18:59.000Z", "videoDuration": 14.2, "videoPlayCount": 19361, "videoViewCount": 4262, "likesCount": 108, "commentsCount": 15, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-man2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/734367491_18606695755038124_2024934335623792336_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-man2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGCkiq7Lg092Tu-27Mofn73ZCSb45IXgAgbTS3yGmhCXBngMJjWqZ-6jvmniGV87oo&_nc_ohc=UwYDSSiq_wkQ7kNvwEYzk6k&_nc_gid=7s7fZ4i0rQtOe9f72uaoFQ&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQCkDnBA5f5Ei2-CQUGLQwK3Dt20-T6XB7lSRh8uPNwj_A&oe=6A6BB3CD&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fltn4-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMocqluOwImxpSQ9EmetfMsLMSP9qzK8dcv6JqjypqjGfYVlK5mJkDZfiz-xbyc_9CvLXuLtuBiwRfVph35XlUCGSDEf8UkkLUzVes.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdpE2pMo39d6lfPKwmETGr5glvLZvSq3lCxs4aOGPzVTqAv_ad332uJAVzcJQdn0_Kg&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fltn4-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=vA8PwlAe4V8Q7kNvwGHmZ6P&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTc4OTg0MTMzMjM4MzA1OCwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjE4LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDgyNywiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MTQsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=ea7ae852875729cd&_nc_&_nc_gid=ZVu3QikBuHD917PWsHo3Cw&_nc_ss=72a8c&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQAkdUvusl285Pm_SHPpy1Dy0mDBsRIs4Htun1Xol2q7Aw&oe=6A67D333", "music